{
  "lineCounts": {
    "Paimon": 4,
    "Player": 3,
    "Ranjit": 13
  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7166701",
      "subQuestName": "Go to Nantianmen",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "716670101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "716670101": {
            "id": "716670101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ranjit",
            "text": "Ah, it's you two! I've been waiting for ages!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716670102"
            ]
          },
          "716670102": {
            "id": "716670102",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Befriended the Pyro Regisvine yet?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716670103"
            ]
          },
          "716670103": {
            "id": "716670103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ranjit",
            "text": "Agh, don't even talk about it. You \"negotiated\" a period of calm... a very, very brief one.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716670104"
            ]
          },
          "716670104": {
            "id": "716670104",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ranjit",
            "text": "The moment it recovered, it started trying to bump me off again! ... You know what? You were right. It's not possible to make friends with this creature.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716670105"
            ]
          },
          "716670105": {
            "id": "716670105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ranjit",
            "text": "Still, its fruit does taste pretty good — like Pyro, in fact. Reckon my Natlan friends will like it!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716670106"
            ]
          },
          "716670106": {
            "id": "716670106",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What does that even taste like...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716670107"
            ]
          },
          "716670107": {
            "id": "716670107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ranjit",
            "text": "Wanna give it a try? If you want, I could...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716670108"
            ]
          },
          "716670108": {
            "id": "716670108",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "E—Err, yeah, no, it's fine! Anyway, are you gonna move on to a Primo Geovishap next?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716670109"
            ]
          },
          "716670109": {
            "id": "716670109",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ranjit",
            "text": "That's right. I think this one's a winner, to be honest. Primo Geovishaps are quite like the Tepetlisauri, after all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716670110"
            ]
          },
          "716670110": {
            "id": "716670110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ranjit",
            "text": "If you travel to Natlan from Sumeru like I did, I reckon they'll be one of the first things you'll meet.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716670111"
            ]
          },
          "716670111": {
            "id": "716670111",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Sure, whatever you say. Paimon doesn't have high hopes for this one either, though... Why couldn't you have gone with the Hatchlings?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716670112"
            ]
          },
          "716670112": {
            "id": "716670112",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ranjit",
            "text": "...They don't have round tummies.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716670113"
            ]
          },
          "716670113": {
            "id": "716670113",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716670114"
            ]
          },
          "716670114": {
            "id": "716670114",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ranjit",
            "text": "Geovishap Hatchlings don't have round tummies. I imagine it's all that incredibly quick rolling they do. That can't leave you much of a chance to store up fat...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716670115"
            ]
          },
          "716670115": {
            "id": "716670115",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ranjit",
            "text": "*sigh* But the main reason's still the lack of... impact. What's a Hatchling to those friends of mine who live alongside Saurians?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716670116"
            ]
          },
          "716670116": {
            "id": "716670116",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ranjit",
            "text": "But a Primo Geovishap, now that's a different story. Even as a tale, it'll be worth the time of day. And anyway, a strong protagonist's gotta have strong opponents, you dig?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716670117"
            ]
          },
          "716670117": {
            "id": "716670117",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ranjit",
            "text": "Alright. Let's not tarry, shall we? The Primo Geovishap awaits!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "716670120"
            ]
          },
          "716670120": {
            "id": "716670120",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Ranjit",
            "text": "No worries. I'll wait for you here."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}